problems.problem:
Rudi and Miljen play a game on a school board, alternately making moves. The player whose turn it is chooses two coprime numbers written on the board, erases them and writes their sum on the board. The player who cannot do this loses. Rudi starts the game. Prove that Miljen has a winning strategy if at the beginning there were written on the board

(a) $2019$ ones;

(b) $2020$ ones.
